# FEATURE COVERAGE SUMMARY
# ============================================================================
# ✅ GameplayTags (80+ tags, hierarchical namespaces)
# ✅ Attribute Sets (5 sets: Health, Combat, Movement, Magic, Stamina)
# ✅ Attribute Replication (replicated, rep_notify, hide_from_modifiers)
# ✅ Meta Attributes (temporary calculation attributes)
# ✅ Attribute Clamping (PreAttributeChange)
# ✅ Attribute Delegates (on_health_changed, on_out_of_health)
# ✅ Gameplay Effects Execute (PostGameplayEffectExecute)
# ✅ Gameplay Abilities (20+ abilities: instant, channeled, passive)
# ✅ Ability Instancing (InstancedPerExecution, InstancedPerActor, NonInstanced)
# ✅ Ability Replication (ReplicateYes, ReplicateNo)
# ✅ Net Execution (LocalPredicted, ServerInitiated, ServerOnly)
# ✅ Ability Tags (ability_tags, activation_required, activation_blocked, activation_owned)
# ✅ Ability Blocking (block_abilities_with_tag, cancel_abilities_with_tag)
# ✅ Cost Effects (mana, stamina, health costs)
# ✅ Cooldown Effects (per-ability cooldowns)
# ✅ Gameplay Effects (30+ effects: instant, duration, infinite)
# ✅ Effect Modifiers (Add, Multiply, Divide, Override operations)
# ✅ Magnitude Types (ScalableFloat, AttributeBased, SetByCaller, CustomCalculation)
# ✅ Effect Stacking (AggregateBySource, AggregateByTarget, policies)
# ✅ Effect Tags (owned_tags, granted_tags)
# ✅ Tag Requirements (application, ongoing, removal)
# ✅ Effect Immunity (immunity component, immune_to tags)
# ✅ Effect Removal (remove_effects_with_tags)
# ✅ Conditional Effects (on_damage_dealt, on_damage_received)
# ✅ Overflow Effects (overheal shields)
# ✅ Gameplay Cues (visual/audio triggers)
# ✅ Tag Queries (any/all/not combinations)
# ✅ Tag Events (@on_tag_added, @on_tag_removed, @on_tag_count_changed)
# ✅ Ability System Component (ASC integration)
# ✅ Attribute Set Management (add_set, get_set)
# ✅ Ability Granting (give_ability, give_ability_and_activate_once)
# ✅ Effect Application (apply_gameplay_effect_to_self, apply_gameplay_effect_to_target)
# ✅ Tag Management (add_loose_tag, remove_loose_tag, has_tag, has_any, has_all)
# ✅ Effect Queries (get_active_effects_with_tags, remove_active_effects_with_tags)
# ✅ Cooldown Queries (get_cooldown_time_remaining, is_ability_on_cooldown)
# ✅ Attribute Queries (get_numeric_attribute, set_numeric_attribute_base)
# ✅ Death System (Lyra pattern with Dying/Dead states)
# ✅ Initialization State Machine (Lyra pattern with 4 states)
# ✅ Movement Mode Tracking (Lyra pattern with tag mapping)
# ✅ Replication Modes (Full, Mixed, Minimal)
# ✅ Network Prediction (client prediction with server reconciliation)
# ✅ Server Authority (server-authoritative damage and effects)
# ✅ Tag Replication (Full, OwnerOnly, Minimal modes)
# ✅ Delegate Binding (attribute change delegates)
# ✅ Input Binding (ability_input_tag_pressed/released)
# ✅ Combo Systems (state-based combo chains)
# ✅ Targeted Abilities (target_required_tags, target_blocked_tags)
# ✅ AOE Abilities (area-of-effect damage)
# ✅ Channeled Abilities (continuous execution)
# ✅ Passive Abilities (auto-activate on avatar set)
# ✅ DOT Effects (damage over time with stacking)
# ✅ HOT Effects (heal over time)
